# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# dragonlink-decomp source hygiene
#
# This repository is PUBLIC. It contains only our own code, tooling, tests,
# format documentation and sanitized metadata. Proprietary source material
# (cabinet software, official mobile packages, extracted assets, captures,
# decompiler output) lives in the private source root OUTSIDE this work tree
# (DRAGONLINK_SOURCE_ROOT) and must never be committed.
# See docs/LEGAL.md, docs/SOURCES.md and CLAUDE.md ("Source material hygiene").
#
# These patterns are a second line of defence. The first is that the private
# source root is not inside the repository at all; the third is
# tools/repo-hygiene, which checks content as well as names.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Rust build output -------------------------------------------------------
/target/
**/target/
*.pdb

# --- Web build output --------------------------------------------------------
/dist/
/web/dist/
/web/pkg/

# --- Private source root, if someone places it inside the work tree ----------
/source-root/
/dragonlink-source/
/evidence/
official-mobile/
cabinet/
captures/
extracted/
decompiler/
temporary/

# --- Imported runtime assets and local full packages (never commit) ----------
/imported/
/dragonlink-data/
/data/
/local-package/
/dist-local/
*.dlpack

